# i18n / locales

- Render user-facing text through the `t("...")` helper or `<Trans>`, never as hardcoded JSX strings.
  Action `label` fields are i18n keys too (e.g. `label: "labels.toggleGrid"`).
- Add new keys ONLY to `packages/excalidraw/locales/en.json`.
- Never edit any other `*.json` file in `locales/` — they are generated from Crowdin
  (see `packages/excalidraw/locales/README.md`). Editing them by hand will be overwritten.
- `percentages.json` is also generated. Do not edit it.

```ts
// BAD
<button>Toggle grid</button>

// GOOD — key added to en.json, referenced by t()
<button>{t("labels.toggleGrid")}</button>
```
